1
00:00:00,158 --> 00:00:02,188
(Howard:)Uh, if you ever need
a reference or anything,

2
00:00:02,193 --> 00:00:04,263
(Howard:)just let me know.

3
00:00:04,262 --> 00:00:05,862
(Man:)Hey, guys.

4
00:00:05,863 --> 00:00:07,063
WOMAN:
You made it.

5
00:00:07,065 --> 00:00:09,265
(Sheldon:)Did you see that?

6
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:11,437
(Sheldon:)He just cut the line.

7
00:00:11,436 --> 00:00:13,036
(Leonard:)He's just joining
his friends; it's fine.

8
00:00:13,037 --> 00:00:14,607
(stammers)
No, it's not fine.

9
00:00:14,606 --> 00:00:16,906
(Sheldon:)It is a breach
of line etiquette.

10
00:00:16,908 --> 00:00:18,378
(Howard:)We're near the front
of the line.

11
00:00:18,376 --> 00:00:19,776
(Howard:)We'll get in either way.

12
00:00:19,777 --> 00:00:21,677
(Sheldon:)What if every person in front
of us lets someone cut?

13
00:00:21,679 --> 00:00:22,219
(Leonard:)We'd still get in.

14
00:00:22,221 --> 00:00:24,181
(Sheldon:)What if each of those people
let someone cut?

15
00:00:24,182 --> 00:00:24,862
(Leonard:)Still get in.

16
00:00:24,889 --> 00:00:26,349
(Sheldon:)But then each of those
people let someone cut?

17
00:00:26,351 --> 00:00:28,281
(Leonard:)We'd still get in,
but first I'd hit you

18
00:00:28,286 --> 00:00:30,586
(Leonard:)over the head
with his stick chair.

19
00:00:32,624 --> 00:00:34,294
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.
Oh, please don't.

20
00:00:34,292 --> 00:00:36,522
(Sheldon:)Uh, uh, I couldn't
help but notice

21
00:00:36,527 --> 00:00:38,257
(Sheldon:)that you cut the line.

22
00:00:38,263 --> 00:00:39,533
(Man:)Oh, uh, I'm with my friends.

23
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,530
(Man:)It's cool.

24
00:00:40,531 --> 00:00:41,731
(Sheldon:)Well, no.

25
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:43,263
(Sheldon:)It's not cool.

26
00:00:43,268 --> 00:00:45,598
(Sheldon:)If there were
reserved seating,

27
00:00:45,603 --> 00:00:47,503
(Sheldon:)and we all had tickets,
that would be fine.

28
00:00:47,505 --> 00:00:48,935
(Sheldon:)But this line is
first-come, first-served.

29
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,340
Not “show up tardy and
nevertheless be first served”.

30
00:00:51,342 --> 00:00:52,612
(Sheldon:)Right here.

31
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:54,810
(Sheldon:)No.

32
00:00:56,581 --> 00:00:58,211
(Sheldon:)You need to go to
the back of the line.

33
00:00:58,216 --> 00:01:01,046
(scoffs)
Uh, who made you line monitor?

